{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
Play in Group H of the [[2006 FIFA World Cup]] began on 14 June and completed on 23 June 2006. [[Spain national football team|Spain]] won the group and advanced to the [[2006 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Round of 16|round of 16]], along with [[Ukraine national football team|Ukraine]]. [[Tunisia national football team|Tunisia]] and [[Saudi Arabia national football team|Saudi Arabia]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |last=Saaid |first=Hamdan |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/2006full.html |title=World Cup 2006 – Match Details |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |date=7 February 2007 |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

